/* ZELN_ABI_VERSION (native-comp Zig path): version tag baked into the
   .zeln freloc hash (plan section 5.2). Always defined in config.h (a
   version string); only consulted by compz.c under HAVE_NATIVE_COMP_ZIG.  */
